{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01F8pMUr9F7VCSwbthnc9mNG","type":"tool_result","content":"--- flow\n99:  { floor: h }        walkable at height h (0 the ground; above 0 a raised floor, solid to the ground)\n127:  world.flow() -> flow: flow.to(x, y) aims it; flow.dir(x, y, out) -> the way there ([x, y], or null: go straight);\n214:and world.terrain.normal(x, y) read the triangles Rapier collides with; flow() goes straight. sky: { top, horizon, ground,\n495: *      { floor: h }                  walkable at height h (units; 0 the ground; a raised floor is solid down to the ground)\n595:  /* the walkable grid: from one tile to the next when neither is solid or a pit, and walking the line between their\n635:/* ---- the flow field: distances along the walkable grid toward one point, recomputed when the point changes tile ---- */\n636:class Flow {\n637:  /** new Flow(level): world.flow() makes one; flow.to(x, y) aims it, flow.dir(x, y, out) reads it */\n1103:/** straight lines over open ground: a terrain's flow field (world.flow()) never steers */\n2311:  /** a new flow field over the walkable grid: flow.to(x, y) aims it, flow.dir(x, y, out) is the way there from (x, y) */\n2312:  flow() { return this.terrain ? new TerrainFlow() : new Flow(this.level); }\n2313:  /** a random walkable spot ([x, y]): rnd (E.rng) picks it, at least minDist from (fx, fy) if given */\n--- platform/multilevel\n103:  { platform: h, thick: 4 }   a slab in the air, its top at h (walk under it); add pit: true for nothing below\n160:  world.platform({ w, d, h, path: [[x, y, z], ...] (its top's points), speed, wait, loop, side, color }): a platform that\n295:const GROUPS = { level: ig(1, 0xffff), platform: ig(64, 0xffff), prop: ig(2, 1 | 2 | 4 | 8 | 32 | 64), hero: ig(4, 1 | 2 | 8 | 64),\n499: *      { platform: h, thick: 4 }     a slab in the air whose top is at h (walk under it); with pit: true, over nothing\n530:      if (sp.platform) { this.plat[i] = sp.pla