{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XNXNywVLmBj2NdrpPBYZcj","type":"tool_result","content":"wrote ../clips-test.js: 53 clips from CMU and QUATERNIUS and MESH2MOTION, 1180 key poses, 350 KB\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha 358078 Nov  4 21:56 ../clips-test.js\n53 clips\n{\"clip\":\"Roundhouse_Kick\",\"src\":\"CMU_135\",\"take\":\"135_07 0.20-6.20\",\"dur\":6,\"loop\":false,\"tags\":[\"attack\",\"kick\"],\"desc\":\"A karate roundhouse kick (mawashi-geri): the leg swings round in an arc at head height\",\"keys\":[{\"t\":0,\"hips\":[0,0,85],\"body\":[3,4,-10],\"chest\":[-12,6,7],\"head\":[-2,3,4],\"root\":[0,0],\"shL\":[0,0],\"shR\":[0,0],\"armL\":[93,5,-37,87,27],\"armR\":[76,18,-62,99,-24],\"legL\":[36,34,-87,80,19],\"legR\":[-51,7,-8\n// shL shR    [reach, shrug]     degrees the shoulder swings forward (into a punch or an aim) and up, from rest\n// armL armR  [forward, out, up, bend, twist]  which way the arm points from the shoulder to the fist, in chest space\n//            (out + = away from the body on that side; [0, 0, -100] hangs down, [100, 0, 0] punches ahead);\n//            bend = elbow bend in degrees (0 = straight); twist = degrees the elbow swings round the arm from its\n//            natural direction (back and down)\n// legL legR  [forward, out, up, bend, twist]  hip to ankle in pelvis space; bend: the knee; twist: from pointing forward\n// footL footR [down, out, toes]   degrees the foot points down from standing, turns outward, and the toes bend up\n// blade  [forward, right, up]   (sword clips) the direction of a blade held in the right fist, in chest space\n// root   [forward, right]       (clips that travel) how far the whole body has moved, in percent of standing hip height`;\n\n/* ---- vectors, frames, rotations ---- */\nconst RV = {\n  sub: (a, b) => [a[0] - b[0], a[1] - b[1], a[2] - b[2]], add: (a, b) => [a[0] + b[0], a[1] + b[1], a[2] + b[2]], mul: (a, k) => [a[0] * k, a[1] * k, a[2] * k],\n  dot: (a, b) => a[0] * b[0] + a[1] * b[1] + a[2] * b[2], len: a => Math.hypot(a[0], a[1], a[2]),\n  cross: (a, b) => [a[1] * b[2] - a[2] * b[1], a[2] * b[0] - a[0] * b[2], a[0] * b[1] - a[1] * b[0]],\n  norm: a => { const l = Math.hypot(a[0], a[1], a[2]) || 1; return [a[0] / l, a[1] / l, a[2] / l]; }\n};\n// a frame is [F, R, U]: its forward, right and up axes written in the parent's coordinates (f x r = u)\nconst frameFR = (right, fwd) => { const R = RV.norm(right), F = RV.norm(RV.sub(fwd, RV.mul(R, RV.dot(fwd, R)))); return [F, R, RV.cross(F, R)]; };\n167: * Mocap.drive(rig, lib): after the rig poses itself each step it takes the pose in rig.mocap (a sampled pose, or\n267:// also window.Mocap (a top-level const is no property of window: a game that looked for window.Mocap found nothing, and its clips silen\n268:if (typeof globalThis !== 'undefined') globalThis.Mocap = Mocap;\n})();\n// also window.Mocap (a top-level const is no property of window: a game that looked for window.Mocap found nothing, and\nif (typeof globalThis !== 'undefined') globalThis.Mocap = Mocap;","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"23de6e6b-3ae6-4bf5-9764-44b18bb5857c","uuid":"36b0903e-e93b-4987-933d-3dd427b746b2","timestamp":"2026-11-05T04:56:26.260Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"wrote ../clips-test.js: 53 clips from CMU and QUATERNIUS and MESH2MOTION, 1180 key poses, 350 KB\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha 358078 Nov  4 21:56 ../clips-test.js\n53 clips\n{\"clip\":\"Roundhouse_Kick\",\"src\":\"CMU_135\",\"take\":\"135_07 0.20-6.20\",\"dur\":6,\"loop\":false,\"tags\":[\"attack\",\"kick\"],\"desc\":\"A karate roundhouse kick (mawashi-geri): the leg swings round in an arc at head height\",\"keys\":[{\"t\":0,\"hips\":[0,0,85],\"body\":[3,4,-10],\"chest\":[-12,6,7],\"head\":[-2,3,4],\"root\":[0,0],\"shL\":[0,0],\"shR\":[0,0],\"armL\":[93,5,-37,87,27],\"armR\":[76,18,-62,99,-24],\"legL\":[36,34,-87,80,19],\"legR\":[-51,7,-8\n// shL shR    [reach, shrug]     degrees the shoulder swings forward (into a punch or an aim) and up, from rest\n// armL armR  [forward, out, up, bend, twist]  which way the arm points from the shoulder to the fist, in chest space\n//            (out + = away from the body on that side; [0, 0, -100] hangs down, [100, 0, 0] punches ahead);\n//            bend = elbow bend in degrees (0 = straight); twist = degrees the elbow swings round the arm from its\n//            natural direction (back and down)\n// legL legR  [forward, out, up, bend, twist]  hip to ankle in pelvis space; bend: the knee; twist: from pointing forward\n// footL footR [down, out, toes]   degrees the foot points down from standing, turns outward, and the toes bend up\n// blade  [forward, right, up]   (sword clips) the direction of a blade held in the right fist, in chest space\n// root   [forward, right]       (clips that travel) how far the whole body has moved, in percent of standing hip height`;\n\n/* ---- vectors, frames, rotations ---- */\nconst RV = {\n  sub: (a, b) => [a[0] - b[0], a[1] - b[1], a[2] - b[2]], add: (a, b) => [a[0] + b[0], a[1] + b[1], a[2] + b[2]], mul: (a, k) => [a[0] * k, a[1] * k, a[2] * k],\n  dot: (a, b) => a[0] * b[0] + a[1] * b[1] + a[2] * b[2], len: a => Math.hypot(a[0], a[1], a[2]),\n  cross: (a, b) => [a[1] * b[2] - a[2] * b[1], a[2] * b[0] - a[0] * b[2], a[0] * b[1] - a[1] * b[0]],\n  norm: a => { const l = Math.hypot(a[0], a[1], a[2]) || 1; return [a[0] / l, a[1] / l, a[2] / l]; }\n};\n// a frame is [F, R, U]: its forward, right and up axes written in the parent's coordinates (f x r = u)\nconst frameFR = (right, fwd) => { const R = RV.norm(right), F = RV.norm(RV.sub(fwd, RV.mul(R, RV.dot(fwd, R)))); return [F, R, RV.cross(F, R)]; };\n167: * Mocap.drive(rig, lib): after the rig poses itself each step it takes the pose in rig.mocap (a sampled pose, or\n267:// also window.Mocap (a top-level const is no property of window: a game that looked for window.Mocap found nothing, and its clips silen\n268:if (typeof globalThis !== 'undefined') globalThis.Mocap = Mocap;\n})();\n// also window.Mocap (a top-level const is no property of window: a game that looked for window.Mocap found nothing, and\nif (typeof globalThis !== 'undefined') globalThis.Mocap = Mocap;","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01XNXNywVLmBj2NdrpPBYZcj","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
