{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Uz1vgUgXCPcNmaKd5EGajb","type":"tool_result","content":"# my-3D2dge API card (v0.88.0)\n# my-3D2dge API card (v0.89.1)\n2:my-3D2dge 3D v0.89.1: real 3D worlds under my-3D2dge games (three.js r182 and Rapier 0.1\n8ecc2f6 2026-11-05T05:25:18Z The cc-matrix plan is done: its prototypes as Temporary labs, the 3D camera's roll, the plan gone (v0.89.1) (#\n9392d09 2026-11-05T04:46:48Z The Humanoid's registries, an effect's handle and instruments, menus and the Shell for a TV (v0.89.0) (#207)\n0a46310 2026-11-05T04:00:52Z More input, and the 2D renderer's floors, sprites, spans, flow fields and colours (v0.88.0) (#206)\n5f44010 2026-11-05T03:27:14Z Input for a shared world, headless tests that see what a player sees, the 3D filter's first person and stacked\n630aa48 2026-11-05T02:34:56Z The matrix run's patches in the engine (v0.86.0), and the fonts as digit rows (v0.86.1) (#204)\nade3a9b 2026-11-05T02:02:28Z A phone's first tap counts, and a drag goes on, as the page goes full screen; the 3D warm-up's shadows (v0.85.\nclone made at: 0a46310 2026-11-04T21:00:52-07:00\n16\n> # my-3D2dge API card (v0.89.1)\n> - Font (5x7 proportional with lower case: ASCII, the face buttons, arrows, ★ ♥ ♪ ✓ … ° € £, the accented Latin letters; any other is `?`; `font: 'tiny'` for 3x5): `E.font.text(g, str, x, y, color, { outline, shadow, gradient, scale, align, wrap, font })`, `E.font.title(g, str, x, y, { scale, color\n> - Menu: `const menu = new E.Menu(game, ['START', { label: 'LOAD', disabled: true }], { x: 'center', y: 100, title, onPick(i, item), onCancel, scale: 2, rows: 6 })` (rows: it scrolls); `menu.update(dt)`; `menu.draw(r)`. Keys, d-pad and sticks move it; a click or tap on an entry picks it (so a phone\n> - HTML screens and HUD: `const ui = new E.Shell(game, { theme: { scale: 2 } (a TV; or `tv: true`), settings, screens: { pause, help, dev: { rows: ['glyphs'] } } })`; `ui.show('title' | 'results' | 'map' | ..., spec)`; each step `ui.hud({ objective, status, bars, prompt, minimap })` (`minimap: { ma\n> - `sfx(name, { vol, pitch, pan, loop })` → `{ stop(), set({ pan, vol }) }` (a loop sounds on: an engine, rain). Presets: `jump jump2 land step coin pickup key powerup oneup heal hit hurt stomp bump swing whoosh punch kick shoot laser charge explode boom door secret warp die select confirm cancel p\n> - Custom: `sfx({ wave: 'square' | 'pulse' | 'pulse12' | 'triangle' | 'saw' | 'sine' | 'noise', freq: 440 or 'A4', to: 880, dur: .2, vol: .3, arp: [0, 4, 7], step: .05, vib: [8, .03] })`, or `audio.define('zap', voice)`; `audio.instrument('pluck', (ctx, bus, time, freq, dur, vol) => ...)` is a `wav\n> **Humanoid** (knights, heroes, soldiers, zombies): `new E.Humanoid({ size: 1.3, build: 'chibi' (default) | 'heroic' (tall) | 'bulky' (brawlers, bosses) | 'skeleton' (tint with colors.bone), weapon: 'sword' (the default) | 'gun' | 'staff' | null (fists) | a game's own (`E.Humanoid.weapon(id, { leng\n> - Poses: `rig.update(dt, { ..., pose: 'cheer' | 'cast' | 'guard' | 'kneel' | 'crouch' | 'wave' | 'hips' | 'down' })` (they blend in and out), `'block'` (weapon upright across the body), `'die'` (a stagger, then the body topples), `expr: 'smile' | 'shout' | 'angry' | 'wince'` (faces and portraits),\n9420:   *   interface that many times (a number, or a function of the window) for a TV across a room; tv: true picks one by\n9450:    const K = th.scale !== undefined ? th.scale : o.tv ? () => clamp(innerWidth * .016, 18, 30) / 14 : 1;   // (for ten feet: the whole interface that many times, still filling the window)","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"23de6e6b-3ae6-4bf5-9764-44b18bb5857c","uuid":"7e62707b-a7b8-4daf-b5aa-44b2cde6e283","timestamp":"2026-11-05T05:31:16.238Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"# my-3D2dge API card (v0.88.0)\n# my-3D2dge API card (v0.89.1)\n2:my-3D2dge 3D v0.89.1: real 3D worlds under my-3D2dge games (three.js r182 and Rapier 0.1\n8ecc2f6