mp swing whoosh punch kick shoot laser charge explode boom door secret warp die select confirm cancel p\n> - Custom: `sfx({ wave: 'square' | 'pulse' | 'pulse12' | 'triangle' | 'saw' | 'sine' | 'noise', freq: 440 or 'A4', to: 880, dur: .2, vol: .3, arp: [0, 4, 7], step: .05, vib: [8, .03] })`, or `audio.define('zap', voice)`; `audio.instrument('pluck', (ctx, bus, time, freq, dur, vol) => ...)` is a `wav\n> **Humanoid** (knights, heroes, soldiers, zombies): `new E.Humanoid({ size: 1.3, build: 'chibi' (default) | 'heroic' (tall) | 'bulky' (brawlers, bosses) | 'skeleton' (tint with colors.bone), weapon: 'sword' (the default) | 'gun' | 'staff' | null (fists) | a game's own (`E.Humanoid.weapon(id, { leng\n> - Poses: `rig.update(dt, { ..., pose: 'cheer' | 'cast' | 'guard' | 'kneel' | 'crouch' | 'wave' | 'hips' | 'down' })` (they blend in and out), `'block'` (weapon upright across the body), `'die'` (a stagger, then the body topples), `expr: 'smile' | 'shout' | 'angry' | 'wince'` (faces and portraits),\n9420:   *   interface that many times (a number, or a function of the window) for a TV across a room; tv: true picks one by\n9450:    const K = th.scale !== undefined ? th.scale : o.tv ? () => clamp(innerWidth * .016, 18, 30) / 14 : 1;   // (for ten feet: the whole interface that many times, still filling the window)","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01Uz1vgUgXCPcNmaKd5EGajb","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
